    "name": "Slice Adventure",
    "steam_appid": 2963080,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963080/extras/e5db8ea3b7c1fe83201177e89dd2f847.poster.avif?t=1743679341\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963080/extras/e5db8ea3b7c1fe83201177e89dd2f847.webm?t=1743679341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FAST, DYNAMIC, WHIMSICAL CHAOS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for high-energy, roguelike action, where speed, precision, and battle collide! In this wildly fun and casual bullet hell experience, you control a mighty cursor-blade, slashing and cutting your way through relentless waves of quirky enemies. With intuitive, one-handed mouse controls, vibrant visuals, and a playful atmosphere, Slice Adventure is the perfect mix of accessible fun and skill-based gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own battle style by combining weapons, skills and items each of which gives you unique opportunities. Slice dozens of enemies with different abilities and don't let them get you out!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SLICE, DODGE, AND SURVIVE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a world where every move counts. Enemies will flood the screen, forcing you to weave through chaotic patterns of attacks while striking back with precise, well-timed slashes. The faster and smarter you move, the longer you'll survive! Dodge incoming projectiles, outmaneuver tricky foes, and get through increasingly intense challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963080/extras/d20a2823f6c7d73cc823419a316e9648.poster.avif?t=1743679341\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963080/extras/d20a2823f6c7d73cc823419a316e9648.webm?t=1743679341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive one-handed gameplay: No need for complex controls\u2014just move your mouse to slice through enemies, dodge hazards, and unleash devastating combos with a flick of the wrist!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless waves of enemies: Face off against an ever-growing army of adorable yet deadly creatures, each with their own attack patterns, and surprises to keep you on your toes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive arsenal of power-ups &amp; abilities: Collect unique power-ups, discover game-changing upgrades, and experiment with different ability synergies to create unstoppable builds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful &amp; whimsical visuals: Enjoy a charming, cartoon-inspired world that\u2019s bursting with personality. From silly enemy designs to explosive effects - it's a visual treat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for quick sessions: Whether you have a few minutes or a few hours, the game is designed to provide instant fun. Jump in for a quick match or challenge yourself to go further than ever before!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963080/extras/6f30afc13b4acbdec4b569bcdbe67a01.poster.avif?t=1743679341\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963080/extras/6f30afc13b4acbdec4b569bcdbe67a01.webm?t=1743679341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BECOME A MASTER OF THE SLICE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agility, reflexes, and a little bit of luck will determine how long you last in this wild adventure. How many waves can you survive? Can you unlock every power-up and discover the craziest build combinations?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your cursor-sword, brace yourself for unrestrained fun, and start slicing!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963080/extras/e5db8ea3b7c1fe83201177e89dd2f847.poster.avif?t=1743679341\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963080/extras/e5db8ea3b7c1fe83201177e89dd2f847.webm?t=1743679341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FAST, DYNAMIC, WHIMSICAL CHAOS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for high-energy, roguelike action, where speed, precision, and battle collide! In this wildly fun and casual bullet hell experience, you control a mighty cursor-blade, slashing and cutting your way through relentless waves of quirky enemies. With intuitive, one-handed mouse controls, vibrant visuals, and a playful atmosphere, Slice Adventure is the perfect mix of accessible fun and skill-based gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own battle style by combining weapons, skills and items each of which gives you unique opportunities. Slice dozens of enemies with different abilities and don't let them get you out!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SLICE, DODGE, AND SURVIVE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a world where every move counts. Enemies will flood the screen, forcing you to weave through chaotic patterns of attacks while striking back with precise, well-timed slashes. The faster and smarter you move, the longer you'll survive! Dodge incoming projectiles, outmaneuver tricky foes, and get through increasingly intense challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963080/extras/d20a2823f6c7d73cc823419a316e9648.poster.avif?t=1743679341\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963080/extras/d20a2823f6c7d73cc823419a316e9648.webm?t=1743679341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive one-handed gameplay: No need for complex controls\u2014just move your mouse to slice through enemies, dodge hazards, and unleash devastating combos with a flick of the wrist!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless waves of enemies: Face off against an ever-growing army of adorable yet deadly creatures, each with their own attack patterns, and surprises to keep you on your toes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive arsenal of power-ups &amp; abilities: Collect unique power-ups, discover game-changing upgrades, and experiment with different ability synergies to create unstoppable builds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful &amp; whimsical visuals: Enjoy a charming, cartoon-inspired world that\u2019s bursting with personality. From silly enemy designs to explosive effects - it's a visual treat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for quick sessions: Whether you have a few minutes or a few hours, the game is designed to provide instant fun. Jump in for a quick match or challenge yourself to go further than ever before!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963080/extras/6f30afc13b4acbdec4b569bcdbe67a01.poster.avif?t=1743679341\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963080/extras/6f30afc13b4acbdec4b569bcdbe67a01.webm?t=1743679341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BECOME A MASTER OF THE SLICE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agility, reflexes, and a little bit of luck will determine how long you last in this wild adventure. How many waves can you survive? Can you unlock every power-up and discover the craziest build combinations?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your cursor-sword, brace yourself for unrestrained fun, and start slicing!</p>",
    "short_description": "Grab the blade and slice through hordes of enemies in this new &quot;bullet hell&quot; game - Slice Adventure! Control a powerful cursor-sword with simple mouse-only controls. Survive endless waves, try your agility, and create unique playstyles using various weapons and items combinations.",
